e the verifier searched the entire `rpmkeys` output for error substrings. Parse the exact package header separately and verify the RSA/SHA256 signature status and candidate key ID. Signature failures, unsigned packages, corrupt payloads and wrong certificates still reject.\n\nValidation: the new regressions first failed on the previous implementation; all 35 verifier tests now pass. An isolated Linux run verifies the same signed public fixture under five path names and rejects three invalid inputs (8/8). The complete local suite passed 586 tests with one existing RPM-tool availability skip; all four repository contracts passed. Independent Standards and Spec reviews cover the three-file change.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-22T17:18:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:42:08Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T17:42:08Z","merged_at":"2026-10-22T17:42:08Z","merge_commit_sha":"721712e6d77c5f159fff94dcdb2bd1fb84ad464c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"No8blackball","id":17797708,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Nzk3NzA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17797708?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball","html_url":"https://github.com/No8blackball","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/No8blackball/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false